{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026bhklNqFcMW1795473758.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>金價從超過一年低位反彈，且升幅一度超過百分之4。</p><p></p><p>紐約期金收市報3,651.4美元一盎司，升136美元，升幅百分之3.8。</p><p></p><p>現貨金價曾升至3,689.64美元，升151.15美元，升幅近百分之4.3，收市升百分之2.7，報3,634.58美元。</p><p></p><p>現貨金價上星期跌超過百分之9，主要受到人工智能概念股急挫拖累，投資者去槓桿所致，但隨著相關股份價格大反彈，推動金價回升。但美國黃金交易所市場分析師威科夫表示，未來幾個交易日將決定金價是否已成功築底，或只是在熊市中的反彈。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T23:42:58.067522+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":233,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T22:41:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T18:57:33.628512+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T23:36:14.682797+00:00","content_hash":"412b96247fe5247e869e8e55c220d0e2cf7ca1ea6149a046281892e907b2725f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T23:42:58.067522+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}